<div class="page-break"></div>

<h1>UCD022: Create Chat Message</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Use Case ID</th><td>UCD022</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Use Case Name</th><td>Create Chat Message</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Created By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Last Updated By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Actor</th><td>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Description</th><td>Actor sends live messages to coordinate booking schedules.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Preconditions</th><td>Booking must be active (not completed or cancelled).</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Postconditions</th><td>Message is stored in database and broadcasted in real-time.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Priority / Frequency</th><td>High / High</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Normal Course of Events</th>
    <td>
      <strong>Actor:</strong><br>
      1. Actor opens active booking details.<br>
      2. Actor inputs text message in text input bar.<br>
      3. Actor clicks "Send" button (or presses Enter key).<br><br>
      <strong>System:</strong><br>
      1.1 System displays booking overview and "Live Chat" widget window.<br>
      3.1 System saves chat message record in database (setting is_read = false).<br>
      3.2 System fires Pusher event broadcast to push message dynamically to recipient viewport.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><th>Alternative Courses</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Exceptions</th><td><strong>Empty message:</strong> (3.1) If text input is blank, system disables send trigger.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Includes</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Notes and Issues</th><td>Live chat messages are isolated to bookingID.</td></tr>
</table>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<h1>UCD023: View Chat Messages</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Use Case ID</th><td>UCD023</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Use Case Name</th><td>View Chat Messages</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Created By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Last Updated By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Actor</th><td>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Description</th><td>Actor views active message logs inside booking chat interface.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Preconditions</th><td>Actor is logged in and booking is active.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Postconditions</th><td>Conversation logs are rendered, and unread flags are marked read.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Priority / Frequency</th><td>High / High</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Normal Course of Events</th>
    <td>
      <strong>Actor:</strong><br>
      1. Actor opens booking details chat window.<br><br>
      <strong>System:</strong><br>
      1.1 System fetches message logs for bookingID.<br>
      1.2 System updates unread messages (setting is_read = true).<br>
      1.3 System renders conversation history vertically in viewport.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><th>Alternative Courses</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Exceptions</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Includes</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Notes and Issues</th><td>Visual indicators (read receipts) update dynamically.</td></tr>
</table>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<h1>UCD024: View Push Notifications</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Use Case ID</th><td>UCD024</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Use Case Name</th><td>View Push Notifications</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Created By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Last Updated By / Date</th><td>Adib / 16-07-2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Actor</th><td>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Description</th><td>Actor views their personal notification list to check recent updates.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Preconditions</th><td>Actor is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Postconditions</th><td>Unread notifications list is displayed and marked as read.</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Priority / Frequency</th><td>High / High</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Normal Course of Events</th>
    <td>
      <strong>Actor:</strong><br>
      1. Actor clicks on the "Notification Bell" icon in top header.<br>
      2. Actor clicks on "Mark all as read" button (or navigates to page).<br><br>
      <strong>System:</strong><br>
      1.1 System fetches unread notifications from DB for authenticated user ID.<br>
      1.2 System displays dropdown showing last 5 unread alerts (Booking assignments, Payment updates, or Cancel logs).<br>
      2.1 System updates all notifications status in database (sets read_at timestamp).<br>
      2.2 System updates header bell icon counter to 0.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><th>Alternative Courses</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Exceptions</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Includes</th><td>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Notes and Issues</th><td>Polling routes fetch unread alert counts periodically.</td></tr>
</table>

